## Model card

- **Claimed name:** OMI Alpha (folder slug `omi-alpha`, id `opencode/omi-alpha`).
- **Finding:** No first-party source (OMI, OpenCode Zen, OpenRouter) publishes a model named "OMI Alpha" with verified specs. The curated meta (1M context, $0.40/$3.20, text+image in) is a scaffolded placeholder. "OMI"/"Omi" refers to BasedHardware's open-source AI wearable device (omi.me), which uses third-party LLMs (OpenAI/Anthropic/etc.) rather than shipping its own "OMI Alpha" model. OpenCode Zen's public catalogue (models.dev, 132 models) contains no `omi-alpha` route.
- **Context window / modalities / pricing:** unverified — adopted from scaffolded meta only.

### Raw benchmarks found

- No verified public benchmark score found for OMI Alpha in any first-party or independent source: no model card, no system card, no API id, no pricing row, no Artificial Analysis / Epoch AI / Vals AI / SWE-bench / BenchLM row.

## Deep second-pass research (2026-10-22)

Independent searches performed (≥5):
1. "OMI Alpha" LLM model benchmark
2. "OMI Alpha" OpenCode Zen opencode model
3. "OMI Alpha" AI model context window pricing
4. "omi-alpha" site:models.dev OR site:opencode.ai
