Result: No LLM named "OMI Alpha" exists. "Omi" is a wearable device (BasedHardware) that consumes third-party LLMs; docs.omi.me lists no "OMI Alpha" model/API. OpenCode Zen catalogue contains no `omi-alpha` route. Conclusion unchanged: no verified model; scores withheld rather than fabricated.

